From 0b172b81e5a33124edb59eae7529a0d0b7299e71 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tamati Taylor <strongsidecreative@protonmail.com>
Date: Sat, 10 Oct 2026 02:03:31 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix everything from the 2026-10-10 full function audit

Database (migration 0021, must be applied before deploying this):
- Ending a trip no longer fails when a vehicle has a compliance alert due;
  alerts set organisation_id and only go to that org's admins; daily
  sweep checks RUC/service-km again
- Driver-finished and admin-closed trips update the vehicle odometer;
  catch-up for odometers that fell behind
- Booking lock now sees other drivers' approved bookings; new
  current_vehicle_reservation() for the vehicle page
- Editing an approved booking works again (resubmit notification org)
- fuel_logs scoped to the organisation; stale unscoped 0003 booking
  policies dropped; trips can't start on another org's vehicle
- notify_booking_driver(): drivers get approve/decline/override pushes
- is_admin() requires an active admin

App:
- Booking times parsed as NZ time (server is UTC); edit form shows NZ time
- Week/month/report boundaries at NZ midnight; reports include admin-
  closed trips
- Photos shrunk in the browser before upload; 4 MB action limit
- QR scan while logged out returns to that vehicle after sign-in
- Admin deactivate blocks login; can't deactivate self or last admin
- Edit Vehicle can change name, rego, make, model
- No more silent "success" on no-op updates (finish trip, cancel booking,
  admin cancel, override, incident status, vehicle edit, booking edit)
- Fuel $/L only uses fill-ups with litres; lighter driver home query
- Failed setup/invite cleans up the half-created login

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
